odes: np.ndarray,\n                     rest_capacity: float, demands: np.ndarray,\n                     distance_matrix: np.ndarray) -> int:\n    if unvisited_nodes.size == 0:\n        return depot\n\n    d_cur = distance_matrix[current_node][unvisited_nodes]\n    d_dep = distance_matrix[depot][unvisited_nodes]\n    base = d_cur - 0.6 * d_dep\n\n    order = np.argsort(base)\n    best_idx = order[0]\n    best_score = base[best_idx]\n\n    span = float(base[order[-1]] - base[order[0]])\n    band = 1e-3 * span + 1e-12\n\n    near = order[base[order] <= best_score + band]\n    if near.size <= 1:\n        return int(unvisited_nodes[best_idx])\n\n    near_nodes = unvisited_nodes[near]\n    near_dep = d_dep[near]\n    near_dem = demands[near_nodes]\n    slack = rest_capacity - near_dem\n\n    feasible = slack >= 0\n    if not np.any(feasible):\n        return int(unvisited_nodes[best_idx])\n\n    # blended refinement: tighter slack plus proximity to depot (return savings)\n    scale = float(np.mean(near_dep)) + 1e-12\n    fit = np.where(feasible, slack / (rest_capacity + 1e-12), np.inf)\n    dep_pen = near_dep / scale\n    blended = fit + 0.5 * dep_pen\n    blended = np.where(feasible, blended, np.inf)\n\n    pick_local = int(np.argmin(blended))\n    return int(near_nodes[pick_local])","code_sha256":"e05f40aa572168b0e3071cce07ff504c64e212146b7271d333a0460fd2684784","elapsed_seconds":0.219,"error_code":null,"error_detail":null,"evaluation_id":"802e3f5c253148ecb22a1b16e5975d8d","generation_parents":[{"algorithm":"Explicit parent","code_sha256":"e6792bef77ce8feeb72e5ed270628a1bd52685b2f7b01e219ed644f5f6997c80","population_member_indices":[0],"selected_parent_position":0},{"algorithm":"The new algorithm keeps the base ordering d_cur - 0.6*d_dep but replaces the near-tie refinement with a wider scale-free relative band (1e-2*span) and a secondary tie-break that prefers larger demand (better packing) among near ties, while falling back to the nearest-depot bias.","code_sha256":